  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/99",
  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><b style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\">#광물특성관찰</b><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><b style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;\">#과학실무원_중요</b><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">실무원샘께&nbsp;실험준비물&nbsp;말씀드리면&nbsp;아이들에게&nbsp;최대한&nbsp;도움이&nbsp;되게&nbsp;세팅을&nbsp;해주십니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">이전&nbsp;학교가&nbsp;남중있어요.&nbsp;남중(야구부있음)-&gt;남중(야구부있음)&nbsp;이동은&nbsp;피하고&nbsp;싶었지만&nbsp;지금&nbsp;학교에&nbsp;실무원샘(지금은&nbsp;바뀜)이&nbsp;&nbsp;워낙&nbsp;괜찮다는&nbsp;정보를&nbsp;듣고&nbsp;이&nbsp;학교로&nbsp;왔습니다.&nbsp;그&nbsp;분도&nbsp;아이들에게&nbsp;도움되는&nbsp;활동이라면&nbsp;적그적으로&nbsp;도와주셨고,&nbsp;지금&nbsp;분도&nbsp;아이들을&nbsp;위한&nbsp;것이라면&nbsp;조금도&nbsp;무언가를&nbsp;귀찮아하지&nbsp;않으세요.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">*&nbsp;과학실무원의&nbsp;업무방식?유형?&nbsp;부산은&nbsp;전산과&nbsp;과학을&nbsp;겸하는&nbsp;경우가&nbsp;많은데,&nbsp;전산을&nbsp;주로&nbsp;하고&nbsp;실험준비를&nbsp;거의&nbsp;안&nbsp;해주시는&nbsp;학교도&nbsp;많다고&nbsp;알고&nbsp;있습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">오늘&nbsp;광물실험&nbsp;준비물&nbsp;세팅해놓으신&nbsp;거&nbsp;보니&nbsp;새삼&nbsp;너무&nbsp;감사한&nbsp;거예요.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">학생중심,&nbsp;과정중심&nbsp;수업을&nbsp;하라고&nbsp;하는데,&nbsp;과학은&nbsp;실험,&nbsp;관찰,&nbsp;탐구가&nbsp;주를&nbsp;이루어야&nbsp;한다고&nbsp;생각합니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">그런데,&nbsp;실무원샘이&nbsp;안&nbsp;계시면&nbsp;이걸&nbsp;어떻게&nbsp;하나..&nbsp;어휴...&nbsp;</span></p><p><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">실무원샘이&nbsp;안&nbsp;계시거나,&nbsp;계셔도&nbsp;적극적이지&nbsp;않은&nbsp;경우가&nbsp;많으시죠?&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">처우개선&nbsp;문제로&nbsp;작년에&nbsp;매우&nbsp;시끄러웠구요.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">(저희&nbsp;실무원샘은&nbsp;작년까지&nbsp;노조간부&nbsp;하셨고,&nbsp;단식투쟁까지&nbsp;하신&nbsp;분이십니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;본인들의&nbsp;입지가&nbsp;굳건해지고&nbsp;인정받으려면&nbsp;선생님들이&nbsp;실험을&nbsp;많이&nbsp;해주셔야&nbsp;된다고&nbsp;생각하시는&nbsp;분이십니다.^^)&nbsp;</span></p><p><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">올해가&nbsp;이&nbsp;학교&nbsp;마지막인데,&nbsp;다음&nbsp;학교&nbsp;걱정이&nbsp;되네요..&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">아..&nbsp;끝을&nbsp;어떻게&nbsp;맺어야&nbsp;할&nbsp;지..&nbsp;하하하&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, 굴림, Verdana, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">결론없는&nbsp;글이었습니다&nbsp;ㅡㅡ;;;</span><br></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9950C0405AC5921807\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"201804051145354_640.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_9950C0405AC592180762A4\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993515405AC592180A\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"201804051145981_640.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_993515405AC592180AF5AA\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E507405AC592180F\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"201804051145628_640.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_99E507405AC592180F92E9\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999881405AC5921803\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"201804051145064_640.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_999881405AC5921803F629\"/></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
